The six .milk files in this directory originate from presets by
Gianluca Boiano (M0Rf30), distributed under the accompanying MIT license.

Upstream: https://github.com/M0Rf30/projectm-presets
Revision: ec5b03901e5715e2ddb30b7d1b0c3b7bf1a9b845
Source directory: presets/

File names retain their preset names, lowercased and hyphenated, without
the upstream "M0Rf30 - " prefix. No external textures or network access
are required. The other twelve presets are generated by Nemo's own source.

Local adaptations:
- Nebula Forge: initialized onset state, smoothed bass accents, rising-edge
  ring triggers, and bounded audio-driven star brightness instead of timed
  flicker amplified by treble.
- Neon Sacred Geometry: removed timer-generated beats when no audio onset
  occurs.
